Package: regionalepi
Title: Regional Infectious Disease Surveillance and Demographic Typologies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Marleen",
    family = "Dettmann",
    email = "mail@marleen-dettmann.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides a reproducible framework for analyzing infectious disease
    surveillance data across German districts in relation to demographic
    typologies. Supports historical reference and dynamic demographic
    typologies, surveillance-data processing, incidence calculation using
    official annual-average population data, regional comparisons, and
    interactive exploration.
